# Pinned publisher key for Ground State web publications.
#
# Format: OpenSSH allowed_signers, see ssh-keygen(1). Exactly one line:
#   ground-state-web-publisher namespaces="ground-state.web-publication.v1" ssh-ed25519 AAAA… <comment>
#
# EMPTY ON PURPOSE until the Mac Mini publisher key exists. While no key is
# pinned, every bundle fails verification: nothing can be published.
#
# The private key exists only on the Mac Mini and never enters this repository.
# Changing this file is a code change: it needs the owner's review (CODEOWNERS),
# and the publication gate refuses it inside a publication PR.
